{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啊」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听人说话啊！我才刚说完，\\n　你们俩别这么亲亲密密的～！」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「听人说话啊！我才刚说完，　你们俩别这么亲亲密密的～！」", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪在一旁啪啪地敲着我俩，我背着理央开始逃跑。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接着熊喵也加了进来，\\n在我们脚下欢快地跑着。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "接着熊喵也加了进来，在我们脚下欢快地跑着。", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
